                    <occupation>politician</occupation>
                    <occupation>lawyer</occupation>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>William Hunter was an American senator (Federalist Party) from 1811-1821. He also studied law at the Inner Temple, London sometime 
  in the period 1791-93.  There is no evidence of any contact with Godwin at that time but there is an entry in September 1817 to 'Hunter, Sen. Am., calls.'</p>
                        <p>For other Hunter entries see the discussion in <persName key="HUN03"/>.</p>
                    </note>
